(313, 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'project', '{\"category_ids\":[\"5\",\"6\",\"7\",\"9\",\"10\"],\"name\":\"Budget Mart\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Portfolio\\\\Models\\\\Project\",\"slug\":\"budget-mart\",\"slug_id\":\"0\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"Budget Mart is a Flutter-based mobile app that helps users browse products, compare deals, and shop smarter with an intuitive, fast, and modern interface.\",\"content\":\"<p data-start=\\\"424\\\" data-end=\\\"624\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"424\\\" data-end=\\\"439\\\">Budget Mart<\\/strong> is a complete cross-platform shopping application built entirely with Flutter, offering a modern, intuitive, and scalable e-commerce experience for both customers and administrators.<\\/p><p data-start=\\\"626\\\" data-end=\\\"667\\\">On the <strong data-start=\\\"633\\\" data-end=\\\"646\\\">user side<\\/strong>, the app provides:<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"668\\\" data-end=\\\"1323\\\"><li data-start=\\\"668\\\" data-end=\\\"727\\\"><p data-start=\\\"670\\\" data-end=\\\"727\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"670\\\" data-end=\\\"693\\\">User Authentication<\\/strong> (sign up, login, social logins)<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"728\\\" data-end=\\\"804\\\"><p data-start=\\\"730\\\" data-end=\\\"804\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"730\\\" data-end=\\\"768\\\">Product Browsing &amp; Advanced Search<\\/strong> with category\\/subcategory filters<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"805\\\" data-end=\\\"874\\\"><p data-start=\\\"807\\\" data-end=\\\"874\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"807\\\" data-end=\\\"833\\\">Detailed Product Pages<\\/strong> with images, descriptions, and pricing<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"875\\\" data-end=\\\"933\\\"><p data-start=\\\"877\\\" data-end=\\\"933\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"877\\\" data-end=\\\"905\\\">Shopping Cart &amp; Wishlist<\\/strong> for easy order management<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"934\\\" data-end=\\\"988\\\"><p data-start=\\\"936\\\" data-end=\\\"988\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"936\\\" data-end=\\\"955\\\">Secure Checkout<\\/strong> with multiple payment gateways<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"989\\\" data-end=\\\"1036\\\"><p data-start=\\\"991\\\" data-end=\\\"1036\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"991\\\" data-end=\\\"1009\\\">Order Tracking<\\/strong> with live status updates<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1037\\\" data-end=\\\"1104\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1039\\\" data-end=\\\"1104\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1039\\\" data-end=\\\"1061\\\">Push Notifications<\\/strong> for offers, discounts, and order updates<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1105\\\" data-end=\\\"1174\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1107\\\" data-end=\\\"1174\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1107\\\" data-end=\\\"1129\\\">Profile Management<\\/strong> for updating personal info and preferences<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1175\\\" data-end=\\\"1249\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1177\\\" data-end=\\\"1249\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1177\\\" data-end=\\\"1208\\\">Favorites &amp; Recently Viewed<\\/strong> for a personalized shopping experience<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1250\\\" data-end=\\\"1323\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1252\\\" data-end=\\\"1323\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1252\\\" data-end=\\\"1291\\\">Store Locator with Maps Integration<\\/strong> for nearby outlets (optional)<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-start=\\\"1325\\\" data-end=\\\"1371\\\">On the <strong data-start=\\\"1332\\\" data-end=\\\"1346\\\">admin side<\\/strong>, Budget Mart includes:<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"1372\\\" data-end=\\\"1927\\\"><li data-start=\\\"1372\\\" data-end=\\\"1426\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1374\\\" data-end=\\\"1426\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1374\\\" data-end=\\\"1396\\\">Dashboard Overview<\\/strong> for monitoring app activity<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1427\\\" data-end=\\\"1494\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1429\\\" data-end=\\\"1494\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1429\\\" data-end=\\\"1451\\\">Product Management<\\/strong> (add, edit, delete, categorize products)<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1495\\\" data-end=\\\"1559\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1497\\\" data-end=\\\"1559\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1497\\\" data-end=\\\"1518\\\">Inventory Control<\\/strong> with stock status and low-stock alerts<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1560\\\" data-end=\\\"1626\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1562\\\" data-end=\\\"1626\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1562\\\" data-end=\\\"1582\\\">Order Management<\\/strong> (view, update, process, and track orders)<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1627\\\" data-end=\\\"1700\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1629\\\" data-end=\\\"1700\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1629\\\" data-end=\\\"1655\\\">Discounts &amp; Promotions<\\/strong> management with coupons or sales campaigns<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1701\\\" data-end=\\\"1763\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1703\\\" data-end=\\\"1763\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1703\\\" data-end=\\\"1722\\\">User Management<\\/strong> (view, block\\/unblock, or verify users)<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1764\\\" data-end=\\\"1840\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1766\\\" data-end=\\\"1840\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1766\\\" data-end=\\\"1789\\\">Reports &amp; Analytics<\\/strong> for sales trends, revenue, and customer behavior<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1841\\\" data-end=\\\"1927\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1843\\\" data-end=\\\"1927\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1843\\\" data-end=\\\"1872\\\">Push Notification Control<\\/strong> to send offers, updates, or alerts directly to users<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-start=\\\"1929\\\" data-end=\\\"2158\\\">With a focus on <strong data-start=\\\"1945\\\" data-end=\\\"2026\\\">clean UI, real-time features, and seamless performance across iOS and Android<\\/strong>, Budget Mart demonstrates the power of Flutter in building a full-scale shopping ecosystem for both customers and administrators.<\\/p><p><img class=\\\"image_resized\\\" style=\\\"aspect-ratio:1206\\/2622;width:25%;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/muhammadasadullah.online\\/storage\\/budget-mart\\/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213652.png\\\" alt=\\\"Simulator Screenshot - iPho