(314, 1, 'Botble\\ACL\\Models\\User', 'project', '{\"category_ids\":[\"5\",\"6\",\"7\",\"9\",\"10\"],\"name\":\"Budget Mart\",\"model\":\"Botble\\\\Portfolio\\\\Models\\\\Project\",\"slug\":\"budget-mart\",\"slug_id\":\"79\",\"is_slug_editable\":\"1\",\"description\":\"Budget Mart is a Flutter-based mobile app that helps users browse products, compare deals, and shop smarter with an intuitive, fast, and modern interface.\",\"content\":\"<p><strong>Budget Mart<\\/strong> is a complete cross-platform shopping application built entirely with Flutter, offering a modern, intuitive, and scalable e-commerce experience for both customers and administrators.<\\/p><p>On the <strong>user side<\\/strong>, the app provides:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>User Authentication<\\/strong> (sign up, login, social logins)<\\/li><li><strong>Product Browsing &amp; Advanced Search<\\/strong> with category\\/subcategory filters<\\/li><li><strong>Detailed Product Pages<\\/strong> with images, descriptions, and pricing<\\/li><li><strong>Shopping Cart &amp; Wishlist<\\/strong> for easy order management<\\/li><li><strong>Secure Checkout<\\/strong> with multiple payment gateways<\\/li><li><strong>Order Tracking<\\/strong> with live status updates<\\/li><li><strong>Push Notifications<\\/strong> for offers, discounts, and order updates<\\/li><li><strong>Profile Management<\\/strong> for updating personal info and preferences<\\/li><li><strong>Favorites &amp; Recently Viewed<\\/strong> for a personalized shopping experience<\\/li><li><strong>Store Locator with Maps Integration<\\/strong> for nearby outlets (optional)<\\/li><\\/ul><p>On the <strong>admin side<\\/strong>, Budget Mart includes:<\\/p><ul><li><strong>Dashboard Overview<\\/strong> for monitoring app activity<\\/li><li><strong>Product Management<\\/strong> (add, edit, delete, categorize products)<\\/li><li><strong>Inventory Control<\\/strong> with stock status and low-stock alerts<\\/li><li><strong>Order Management<\\/strong> (view, update, process, and track orders)<\\/li><li><strong>Discounts &amp; Promotions<\\/strong> management with coupons or sales campaigns<\\/li><li><strong>User Management<\\/strong> (view, block\\/unblock, or verify users)<\\/li><li><strong>Reports &amp; Analytics<\\/strong> for sales trends, revenue, and customer behavior<\\/li><li><strong>Push Notification Control<\\/strong> to send offers, updates, or alerts directly to users<\\/li><\\/ul><p>With a focus on <strong>clean UI, real-time features, and seamless performance across iOS and Android<\\/strong>, Budget Mart demonstrates the power of Flutter in building a full-scale shopping ecosystem for both customers and administrators.<\\/p><p><img class=\\\"image_resized\\\" style=\\\"aspect-ratio:1200\\/1200;width:25%;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/muhammadasadullah.online\\/storage\\/budget-mart\\/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213652.png\\\" alt=\\\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-09-18 at 21.36.52\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"1200\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"><img class=\\\"image_resized\\\" style=\\\"aspect-ratio:1200\\/1200;width:25%;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/muhammadasadullah.online\\/storage\\/budget-mart\\/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213700.png\\\" alt=\\\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-09-18 at 21.37.00\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"1200\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"><img class=\\\"image_resized\\\" style=\\\"aspect-ratio:1200\\/1200;width:25%;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/muhammadasadullah.online\\/storage\\/budget-mart\\/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213702.png\\\" alt=\\\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-09-18 at 21.37.02\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"1200\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\"><img class=\\\"image_resized\\\" style=\\\"aspect-ratio:1200\\/1200;width:25%;\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/muhammadasadullah.online\\/storage\\/budget-mart\\/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213708.png\\\" alt=\\\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 P