(8, 'Session Buddy', 'Cannabis Tracking Companion', '<p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Session Buddy is a thoughtful companion app for cannabis users who want to track their sessions, monitor buzz levels, and reflect on usage habits. The app enables users to log strain type, consumption method, and their mood/energy levels before and after each session. A unique buzz score is calculated based on inputs, helping users gain insights into their reactions and patterns. Built on Firebase Realtime Database for live data sync and powered by GetX for efficient state updates, the app prioritizes clean design and user privacy. It\'s a niche lifestyle utility that blends tracking with mindful consumption.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Tech Stack:&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">&nbsp;Flutter, Dart, Firebase (Realtime Database + Auth), GetX</span></p><p><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1206/2622;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/session-buddy/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-22-at-235721.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-22 at 23.57.21\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1206\" height=\"2622\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1206/2622;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/session-buddy/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-22-at-235727.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-22 at 23.57.27\" width=\"1206\" height=\"2622\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1206/2622;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/session-buddy/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-22-at-235743.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-22 at 23.57.43\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1206\" height=\"2622\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1206/2622;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/session-buddy/simulator-