ro - 2025-07-22 at 23.58.23\" width=\"1206\" height=\"2622\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1206/2622;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/session-buddy/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-22-at-235825.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-22 at 23.58.25\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1206\" height=\"2622\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1206/2622;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/session-buddy/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-22-at-235835.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-22 at 23.58.35\" width=\"1206\" height=\"2622\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:75%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:1206/2622;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/session-buddy/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-22-at-235753.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-22 at 23.57.53\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1206\" height=\"2622\"><figcaption>&nbsp;</figcaption></figure><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, 0, 'thumnails/3.png', NULL, 0, 'published', '2025-07-24 01:06:45', '2025-08-04 19:38:05', NULL, '2025-05-01', 0),
(9, 'BluePrint Health And Fitness', 'Blueprint Health & Fitness is a comprehensive Flutter-based fitness app designed to help clients track their workouts, receive personalized programs, and stay connected with trainers. It blends sleek UI with powerful real-time functionality using Firebase and RESTful APIs.', '<p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Blueprint Health &amp; Fitness</strong> is a full-featured health and wellness app built using <strong>Flutter</strong> and <strong>GetX</strong>, tailored for both gym clients and trainers. The app enables users to access daily workout routines, track progress, and engage with custom video content — all within a responsive, user-friendly interface.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Trainers have dedicated dashboards to assign personalized programs, monitor client performance, and manage event schedules. Clients can track exercise history, view in-body reports, and access training materials directly in-app through <strong>embedded WebViews</strong> and <strong>YouTube content</strong>.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">With a hybrid backend architecture combining <strong>Firebase</strong> (for real-time updates, authentication, and cloud messaging) and <strong>REST APIs</strong> (for structured data operations), the app ensures fast and reliable communication between users and backend services. It also includes <strong>push notifications</strong> to improve trainer-client engagement and ensure users stay on top of their schedules.</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">💪 Users Can:</span></h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Log in securely and access personalized workout plans</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Track exercise results with history and progress overview</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Watch fitness videos and tutorials embedded from YouTube</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Book sessions or contact trainers via in-app forms</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Receive real-time updates and reminders through notifications</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">View reports, schedules, and event bookings from their dashboard</span></li></ul><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🔧 Key Features:</span></h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">📅 Daily workout logging and performance tracking</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🧑‍🏫 Trainer dashboard with client-specific assignments</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🎥 WebView integration for in-app video content (YouTube, tutorials)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">📬 Event booking and contact form screens</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">⚡ Real-time updates via Firebase and cloud messaging</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🔗 Hybrid architecture: Firebase + REST API</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🎨 Clean UI built with reusable GetX components</span></li></ul><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🧩 Tech Stack:</span></h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Frontend:</strong> Flutter (Dart)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>State Management:</strong> GetX</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Backend:</strong> Firebase (Auth, Firestore, FCM), RESTful API (Node.js/MySQL)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Media &amp; Content:</strong> WebView + YouTube</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>UI Toolkit:</strong> flutter_screenutil, custom theming</span></li></ul><p><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/blueprint-health-and-fitness/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-22-at-235959.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-22 at 23.59.59\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:49.98%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/blueprint-health-and-fitness/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-000002.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.00.02\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/blueprint-health-and-fitness/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-000004.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.00.04\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/blueprint-health-and-fitness/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-000031.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.00.31\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/blueprint-health-and-fitness/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-000032.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.00.32\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/blueprint-health-and-fitness/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-000035.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.00.35\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/blueprint-health-and-fitness/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-000038.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.00.38\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50