(10, 'Jordanian Sports', 'JSC is a full-featured Flutter mobile application designed to enhance sports engagement and team organization across Jordan. It blends match registration, e-commerce, and player tracking into one seamless platform with support for role-based access, order management, and localized content.', '<p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>JSC (Jordanian Sports Club)</strong> is a powerful sports community and e-commerce app developed using <strong>Flutter</strong> and <strong>GetX</strong>, built to empower local athletes, organizers, and businesses in Jordan. The app provides a centralized platform for users to <strong>register for matches</strong>, <strong>track performance</strong>, <strong>shop for sports products</strong>, and <strong>engage with teams</strong> through dedicated role-based features.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">The system supports <strong>multiple user roles</strong> including players, referees, organizers, and videographers, each with customized access and workflows. Athletes can view and register for ongoing tournaments, access their <strong>Golden Card profiles</strong>, and track performance over time.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">The built-in e-commerce module offers full product browsing, cart management, and <strong>real-time order tracking</strong>. Users can favorite items using SharedPreferences and interact with the platform in both <strong>English and Arabic</strong>, thanks to built-in localization.</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">⚽️ Users Can:</span></h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Register for matches and sports events</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Apply for roles (referee, organizer, videographer)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">View personal game history and <strong>Golden Card rankings</strong></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Browse and purchase sports products from the in-app store</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Track their order status in real-time</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Use the app in either English or Arabic</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">Save favorite products locally with Shared Preferences</span></li></ul><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🔧 Key Features:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🎯 Real-time match registration &amp; availability</span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">⭐ Golden Card player stats &amp; tier-based rankings</span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🛒 E-commerce store with cart, product details &amp; discounts</span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">📦 Order tracking with delivery status updates</span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🎥 Role-based team registration system (referee, organizer, etc.)</span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🌍 Multilingual support (Arabic &amp; English)</span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">💾 Persistent local data with SharedPreferences</span> &nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🔐 JWT-based authentication and role-secure UI rendering</span></p><hr><h3><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🧩 Tech Stack:</span></h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Frontend:</strong> Flutter (Dart)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>State Management:</strong> GetX</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Backend Integration:</strong> RESTful APIs</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Authentication:</strong> JWT (token-based login &amp; roles)</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Local Storage:</strong> Shared Preferences</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Multilingual Support:</strong> Flutter Localization (EN/AR)</span></li></ul><p><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/jsc/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-001016.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.10.16\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/jsc/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-001018.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.10.18\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/jsc/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-001021.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.10.21\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/jsc/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-001029.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.10.29\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/jsc/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-001031.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.10.31\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/jsc/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-001032.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.10.32\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/jsc/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-07-23-at-001035.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-07-23 at 00.10.35\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"