le=\"aspect-ratio:540/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://devzephyr.com/storage/green-guide/whatsapp-image-2025-07-23-at-220423.jpeg\" alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2025-07-23 at 22.04.23\" width=\"540\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:540/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://devzephyr.com/storage/green-guide/whatsapp-image-2025-07-23-at-220424.jpeg\" alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2025-07-23 at 22.04.24\" width=\"540\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:540/1200;width:50%;\" src=\"https://devzephyr.com/storage/green-guide/whatsapp-image-2025-07-23-at-220424-1.jpeg\" alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2025-07-23 at 22.04.24 (1)\" width=\"540\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br>&nbsp;</p><figure class=\"image image_resized\" style=\"width:75%;\"><img style=\"aspect-ratio:540/1200;\" src=\"https://devzephyr.com/storage/green-guide/whatsapp-image-2025-07-23-at-220424-2.jpeg\" alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2025-07-23 at 22.04.24 (2)\" width=\"540\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>&nbsp;</figcaption></figure><p><br>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, 0, 'thumnails/8.png', NULL, 0, 'published', '2025-07-25 18:45:09', '2025-07-25 18:45:11', NULL, '2025-03-01', 0),
(12, 'Clinic Token Control System', 'A Flutter desktop application for managing clinic patient tokens with multi-window public display, real-time updates, and Urdu voice announcements.', '<p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">The <strong>Clinic Token Control System</strong> is a modern Flutter desktop application built to streamline patient flow in clinics and hospitals. It allows staff to manage patient tokens while simultaneously providing a public-facing fullscreen display that shows the currently active token number in bold, large digits.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Core Features</strong>:</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Multi-Window Support</strong> – Uses <code>desktop_multi_window</code> to open a separate public display window, which can be moved to a different monitor for waiting rooms.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Token Management</strong> – Staff can add tokens manually or auto-increment them as patients are served.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Public Display</strong> – A fullscreen window shows the current token number in large text, along with scrolling notices powered by Marquee.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Announcements</strong> – Integrated Urdu Text-to-Speech and bell sound to call patients when a new token is displayed.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Prayer Break Mode</strong> – Allows pausing the queue for prayer time, showing a large Urdu message “وقفہ برائے نماز” overlay on the public screen.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Customizable UI</strong> – Built using reusable widgets, a modular theming system (<code>AppColors</code>), and full Urdu typography support (Jameel Noori font).</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">This project demonstrates strong expertise in Flutter desktop development, multi-window state management, real-time UI updates, and localized UX design tailored specifically for healthcare environments.</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:21px;\">🛠 Tech Stack</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Frontend / UI:</strong> Flutter (Dart)</span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Desktop Support:</strong> Flutter Desktop (Windows / Linux / Mac)</span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Multi-Window Management:</strong> <code>desktop_multi_window</code></span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>UI Components:</strong> Custom Widgets, Material UI, Marquee Text</span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>State Management:</strong> <code>ValueNotifier</code> + <code>setState</code></span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Speech &amp; Audio:</strong> Flutter TTS (Text-to-Speech), audio notifications</span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:21px;\"><strong>Custom Theming:</strong> <code>AppColors</code> with primary / secondary palette</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/token/whatsapp-image-2025-08-12-at-093922.jpeg\" alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2025-08-12 at 09.39.22\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><img src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/token/whatsapp-image-2025-08-12-at-093908.jpeg\" alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2025-08-12 at 09.39.08\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, 0, 'token/thumnail2.png', NULL, 0, 'published', '2025-08-19 12:08:43', '2025-08-19 12:08:47', NULL, NULL, 0),
(13, 'Budget Mart', 'Budget Mart is a Flutter-based mobile app that helps users browse products, compare deals, and shop smarter with an intuitive, fast, and modern interface.', '<p><strong>Budget Mart</strong> is a complete cross-platform shopping application built entirely with Flutter, offering a modern, intuitive, and scalable e-commerce experience for both customers and administrators.</p><p>On the <strong>user side</strong>, the app provides:</p><ul><li><strong>User Authentication</strong> (sign up, login, social logins)</li><li><strong>Product Browsing &amp; Advanced Search</strong> with category/subcategory filters</li><li><strong>Detailed Product Pages</strong> with images, descriptions, and pricing</li><li><strong>Shopping Cart &amp; Wishlist</strong> for easy order management</li><li><strong>Secure Checkout</strong> with multiple payment gateways</li><li><strong>Order Tracking</strong> with live status updates</li><li><strong>Push Notifications</strong> for offers, discounts, and order updates</li><li><strong>Profile Management</strong> for updating personal info and preferences</li><li><strong>Favorites &amp; Recently Viewed</strong> for a personalized shopping experience</li><li><strong>Store Locator with Maps Integration</strong> for nearby outlets (optional)</li></ul><p>On the <strong>admin side</strong>, Budget Mart includes:</p><ul><li><strong>Dashboard Overview</strong> for monitoring app activity</li><li><strong>Product Management</strong> (add, edit, delete, categorize products)</li><li><strong>Inventory Control</strong> with stock status and low-stock alerts</li><li><strong>Order Management</strong> (view, update, process, and track orders)</li><li><strong>Discounts &amp; Promotions</strong> management with coupons or sales campaigns</li><li><strong>User Management</strong> (view, block/unblock, or verify users)</li><li><strong>Reports &amp; Analytics</strong> for sales trends, revenue, and customer behavior</li><li><strong>Push Notification Control</strong> to send offers, updates, or alerts directly to users</li></ul><p>With a focus on <strong>clean UI, real-time features, and seamless performance across iOS and Android</strong>, Budget Mart demonstrates the power of Flutter in building a full-scale shopping ecosystem for both customers and administrators.</p><p><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:25%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/budget-mart/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213652.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-09-18 at 21.36.52\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:25%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/budget-mart/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213700.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-09-18 at 21.37.00\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:25%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/budget-mart/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213702.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-09-18 at 21.37.02\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:25%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/budget-mart/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213708.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-09-18 at 21.37.08\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><br><br><br><br><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:25%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasadullah.online/storage/budget-mart/simulator-screenshot-iphone-16-pro-2025-09-18-at-213713.png\" alt=\"Simulator Screenshot - iPhone 16 Pro - 2025-09-18 at 21.37.13\" width=\"1200\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\"><img class=\"image_resized\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1200/1200;width:25%;\" src=\"https://muhammadasa